= Wang Jingwei

One of the most senior officials in the party and close confidant of Sun Yat-sen, if there is anyone who can be said to form the core of the KMT, it is Wang Jingwei. An advocate for the mass party and for social reform, while he holds sympathy for the Communist Party and desires to maintain the United Front he has no particular love for Marxism. Here is a man who will surely never betray China. 

